#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "您好！"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Indico needs just a little bit more data from you..."
msgstr "Indico 需要你提供更多的數據…"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/web/templates/_session_bar.html
msgid "This is your current language."
msgstr "這是您當前的語言。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Administrator Account"
msgstr "管理員帳號"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Insert here all basic information needed to create your account."
msgstr "在這兒插入所有創建帳號需要的基本信息。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid ""
"You can change any extra parameters (like your address or phone number) "
"afterwards by accessing \"Account Details\" (from \"My Profile\")."
msgstr "之後，您可以通過訪問 「帳戶詳細信息」（從「我的個人信息」）更改任何其他參數（如您的地址或電話號碼）。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Site configuration"
msgstr "站點配置"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "These are the default parameters for your Indico site."
msgstr "這些是您的 Indico 站點的默認參數。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid ""
"Please note that this information will also be used for your own user "
"profile. You can change it later."
msgstr "請注意這些信息將還用於您自己的個人信息。稍後你可以修改。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The time zone for the server has been set to %(timezone)s and can be "
"modified in <span class=\"mono\">indico.conf</span>."
msgstr "伺服器的時區%(timezone)s可以在 <span class=\"mono\"> indico.conf  </span> 裡設置和修改。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Let us know you exist!"
msgstr "讓我們知道您的存在！"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid ""
"Be part of the ever growing Indico community! Choose to receive news on the "
"latest releases (2–3 times per year) as well as important security "
"advisories."
msgstr "加入不斷發展的Indico社區！ 選擇接收有關最新版本的新聞（每年2-3次）以及重要的安全公告。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "The following data will be sent to the Community Hub:"
msgstr "以下數據將發送到社區中心："

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Server URL"
msgstr "服務的 URL"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Indico version installed"
msgstr "安裝了的 Indico版本"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Python version used"
msgstr "使用的 Python 版本"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Postgres version used"
msgstr "使用的 Postgres 版本"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Operating system used"
msgstr "使用的作業系統"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Debug mode"
msgstr "調試模式"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
#: indico/modules/events/payment/templates/management/payments.html
msgid "enabled"
msgstr "啟用"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Basic statistics (number of events, contributions and users)"
msgstr "基本統計(活動，報告和用戶數)"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Server default language"
msgstr "服務默認語言"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Contact person"
msgstr "聯繫人"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
#: indico/modules/cephalopod/templates/cephalopod.html
msgid "Affiliation of your Indico server"
msgstr "Indico 伺服器的從屬關係"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid ""
"Please note that <strong>no private information</strong> will ever be sent "
"to the Community Hub or the Indico Project and that you can disable it any "
"time (from the \"Community Hub\" section of the administrative area)."
msgstr ""
"請注意<strong>不會有私有信息</strong> 被送到社區中心或者 Indico 項目並且您可以在任何時候禁用它 (從管理區域的 「社區中心」 "
"部分) 。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/bootstrap.html
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "完成"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/flash_messages.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Indico is now ready and you are logged as %(name)s with administrative "
"rights!<br> Don't forget to tweak <a href=\"%(settings_link)s\">Indico's "
"settings</a> and update your <a href=\"%(profile_link)s\">profile</a>."
msgstr ""
"Indico現在已準備就緒，您將以具有管理權限的 %(name)s  登錄！<br>別忘了調整 <a "
"href=\"%(settings_link)s\"> indico 的設置</a>並更新您的<a "
"href=\"%(profile_link)s\">個人信息</a>"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/flash_messages.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Indico community, your server has been registered to the "
"Community Hub!<br> You can manage it <a href=\"%(link)s\">here</a>."
msgstr "歡迎使用 Indico 社區，您的伺服器已註冊到社區中心！<br>您可以在<a href=\"%(link)s\">這裡</a>管理它。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/flash_messages.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Registration to the Community Hub timed-out. Please try again in a while <a "
"href=\"%(link)s\">here</a>."
msgstr "註冊社區中心超時。請過一會兒在<a href=\"%(link)s\">這裡</a>重試。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/flash_messages.html
#, python-format
msgid "Failed to register to the Community Hub: %(err)s."
msgstr "註冊社區中心失敗：%(err)s。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/flash_messages.html
#, python-format
msgid "See the logs for details and try again <a href=\"%(link)s\">here</a>."
msgstr "有關詳細信息，請參閱日誌，然後在<a href=\"%(link)s\">此處</a>重試。"

#: indico/modules/bootstrap/templates/flash_messages.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An unexpected exception happened while registering the server to the "
"Community Hub: %(err)s."
msgstr "註冊伺服器到社區中心時發生意外異常：%(err)s。"

